{"title":"Ending Maker","synopsis":"Ada dua orang yang sangat tergila-gila dengan game Legend of Heroes 2 hingga menghabiskan ribuan jam untuk memainkannya.&#x20;\n\nYang selalu berada di peringkat pertama, Kang Jinho, dan yang selalu berada di peringkat kedua, Hong Yoohee.\n\nSuatu hari, begitu tersadar, mereka telah bereinkarnasi menjadi karakter mereka di dalam game…&#x20;\n\n“Hei… Kau juga?”&#x20;\n\n“Hei… Aku juga!”&#x20;\n\nEnding dari Legend of Heroes 2 adalah akhir dari dunia manusia. Namun, alih-alih hanya satu orang, justru dua orang telah bereinkarnasi secara bersamaan. Apalagi mereka bukan sembarang orang, melainkan player Rank 1 dan Rank 2 di server, Situasinya bisa menjadi berbeda.&#x20;\n\nPerjalanan para gamer veteran untuk mencapai happy ending dimulai sekarang!","alternative_title":"엔딩메이커","author":"Chwiryong","artist":"DOES","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Game","Romance","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"0a2e8954-c563-4988-954a-abbf8d1a47a9","number":"82","title":"Chapter 82","date":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"id":"c6f952b5-976b-4876-bfb3-cbd687866b25","number":"81","title":"Chapter 81","date":"2026-07-24","images":[]},{"id":"1721455e-84bb-4349-bcd3-ff9c2957bb00","number":"80","title":"Chapter 80","date":"2026-07-17","images":[]},{"id":"6dcaaf74-ef55-4951-a631-22ac9bc499aa","number":"79","title":"Chapter 79","date":"2026-07-04","images":[]},{"id":"c988dc00-1418-4b3a-a9df-e704999801ac","number":"78","title":"Chapter 78","date":"2026-06-27","images":[]},{"id":"e2ea7b44-9dbf-4c1e-b540-c1a8c36b7329","number":"77","title":"Chapter 77","date":"2026-06-19","images":[]},{"id":"cda90863-79a1-4a17-a5c9-4b02d68b2586","number":"76","title":"Chapter 76","date":"2026-06-12","images":[]},{"id":"4ff7db6b-5f6a-4cd6-ade8-2180ec301f13","number":"75","title":"Chapter 75","date":"2026-06-05","images":[]},{"id":"0c437efd-5ccf-4eaa-8b4d-c9b194b9c7df","number":"74","title":"Chapter 74","date":"2026-05-22","images":[]},{"id":"4c21dee2-9b96-42b8-aa5d-0e201f069a6f","